### CreditDesk API — manual requests
### Open in VS Code / Codespaces with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above each block.
### Start the stack first: `docker compose up --build` (repository root).

@base = http://localhost:8080

### Search customers (CPF comes back masked)
GET {{base}}/api/customers?size=20

### Search by part of the name, case-insensitive
GET {{base}}/api/customers?name=silva

### Register an individual (PF) — the CPF below is a generated test number
# @name newCustomer
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PF",
  "document": "529.982.247-25",
  "name": "Maria da Silva",
  "email": "maria.silva@example.com",
  "monthlyRevenue": 8500.00
}

### Same document again → 409 duplicate-document
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PF",
  "document": "52998224725",
  "name": "Maria Duplicada",
  "email": "dup@example.com",
  "monthlyRevenue": 100
}

### Invalid CPF → 400 with the field error
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PF",
  "document": "529.982.247-24",
  "name": "Check Digit Wrong",
  "email": "x@example.com",
  "monthlyRevenue": 100
}

### Company (PJ) with the new alphanumeric CNPJ (Receita Federal's example)
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PJ",
  "document": "12.ABC.345/01DE-35",
  "name": "Exemplo Alfanumérico Ltda",
  "email": "financeiro@example.com",
  "monthlyRevenue": 320000
}

### Update the customer created above
PUT {{base}}/api/customers/{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria da Silva Souza",
  "email": "maria.souza@example.com",
  "monthlyRevenue": 9200.00
}

### Create a proposal (always DRAFT) — response includes the Tabela Price installment
# @name newProposal
POST {{base}}/api/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "kind": "NEW_CREDIT",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "installments": 24,
  "monthlyRate": 0.0199
}

### Edit the draft
PUT {{base}}/api/proposals/{{newProposal.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "NEW_CREDIT",
  "amount": 18000.00,
  "installments": 36,
  "monthlyRate": 0.0189
}

### Delete a customer with an open proposal → 422
DELETE {{base}}/api/customers/{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}

### Proposals of the last 30 days (default), newest first
GET {{base}}/api/proposals

### Filter by status and period (max 90 days)
GET {{base}}/api/proposals?status=APPROVED&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-11-04&size=50

### Period longer than 90 days → 400 invalid-period
GET {{base}}/api/proposals?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-11-04

### Health probes used by Kubernetes
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness
